      "cooked": "<p>If a card says \"deal 1 damage to a target, cards dealt damage in this way suffer X effect\" is dealing the damage enough to trigger the effect? &nbsp;Or dies the target have to take damage after reduction is applied.</p><p>I used to think that the target had to take damage to trigger the effect, but there's a mr fixer card that's worded to specifically reference \"taking damage\" as opposed to \"dealt\" so I was unsure.</p><p>thanks!</p>",
