      "raw": "<p>If a card says &quot;deal 1 damage to a target, cards dealt damage in this way suffer X effect&quot; is dealing the damage enough to trigger the effect? &nbsp;Or dies the target have to take damage after reduction is applied.</p><p>I used to think that the target had to take damage to trigger the effect, but there&#39;s a mr fixer card that&#39;s worded to specifically reference &quot;taking damage&quot; as opposed to &quot;dealt&quot; so I was unsure.</p><p>thanks!</p>",
